"value":1,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4748030","error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-2876130","metric":"price_final","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:44:55Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":2876130,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"currency":null,"divisor":100,"initial":null,"discount_percent":null,"is_free":false,"formatted_final_price":null,"is_free_field_present":false,"is_coming_soon":true,"is_coming_soon_field_present":true},"error_code":"price_not_announced"},{"game_id":"steam-2876130","metric":"review_count","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:44:55Z","status":"ok","value":0,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":2876130,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":null},{"game_id":"steam-2876130","metric":"review_positive_percent","observed_at":"2026-10-26T14:44:55Z","status":"unavailable","value":null,"source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":2876130,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2876130-1847286114040840","game_id":"steam-2876130","kind":"update","title":"Launch Update Patchnotes (it is a big one)","summary":"Update Notes Hey everyone! 👋 This is a big one, the update for the full version! Fueling got a brand-new look, the workshop got a complete overhaul, the car wash feels like a real pressure washer now, the leaderboards have new tabs, and a long list of your reports has been fixed. Here's everything: ⛽ Fueling Brand-new fuel gauge: the old fueling window has been replaced by a vintage analog gauge on a rusty metal plate, with a real needle, a liter counter and a target marker The needle swings and","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T22:42:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114040840","verified_at":"2026-10-25T02:12:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2876130-1843481262693422","game_id":"steam-2876130","kind":"update","title":"A big update - and ready for Next Fest!","summary":"Hey everyone! 👋 The feedback over the last weeks has been fantastic. So many detailed reports, ideas and honest opinions - and a lot of it went straight into this update. Genuinely, thank you. 💜 Your chat can join the game The big one: Twitch integration. Connect your channel once, and at the start of every day your viewers can type \"join\" in chat - they'll show up at your station as customers, walking around with their chat name above their head in their own chat colour. Leave them a bad experi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-10T21:15:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262693422","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:25:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2876130-1840310314340266","game_id":"steam-2876130","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank You for the Amazing Demo Feedback! (8 Patches in 12 Days! 🚀)","summary":"Hey everyone! 👋The response to the demo over the last couple of weeks has been incredible. I just wanted to take a moment to say a massive THANK YOU to each and every one of you who played, streamed, and dropped feedback in the forums or on Discord.Seeing your Let's Plays and reading your constructive reports gives me so much energy to make this game the best it can possibly be.I've been grinding hard behind the scenes to fix your pet peeves. Here is what we accomplished together in just 12 days","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T21:40:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314340266","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:25:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2876130-1839041357033637","game_id":"steam-2876130","kind":"announcement","title":"1,000+ DEMO-DOWNLOADS IN 24h & 5 HOTFIXES – THANK YOU FOR THE SUPPORT!","summary":"OVERWHELMING! 🚀Over 1,000 downloads in the first 24 hours!I am absolutely speechless and blown away by the incredible response, your amazing feedback, and all the new wishlists!To tackle your bug reports and feedback as fast as possible, we actually released 5 patches in a single day! 🛠️⚡As a solo developer, this support means the world to me. A massive THANK YOU to everyone playing the demo and supporting the project! ❤️","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-26T11:38:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357033637","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:25:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2876130-1839041357030839","game_id":"steam-2876130","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Release!","summary":"The Demo is finally here! 🚀Hello everyone!The time has finally come – my demo is out now! This is an absolute milestone for me and a really big deal. I’ve poured my heart and soul into development over the last 3 years to get the game to exactly this point.I am incredibly thrilled and grateful for every single one of you who takes the time to download and check out the demo.Since the game is still in development, you might still encounter a few bugs or glitches here and there. If you notice anyt","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-24T22:09:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357030839","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:25:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2876130-1832065502824961","game_id":"steam-2876130","kind":"announcement","title":"9 Languages Ready for Launch","summary":"🌍 Fuel Station Simulator – Fully Localized in 9 LanguagesWhen Fuel Station Simulator hits Early Access this October, it will be fully localized in 9 languages from day one.🇬🇧 English🇩🇪 German🇫🇷 French🇪🇸 Spanish🇵🇱 Polish🇹🇷 Turkish🇷🇺 Russian🇧🇷 Portuguese (BR)🇮🇹 ItalianEvery menu, tooltip, and line of in-game text will be available in your language on launch day. Switch at any time in Settings – no restart needed.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-12T21:00:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832065502824961","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:25:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2876130-1830797770243610","game_id":"steam-2876130","kind":"announcement","title":"Release Date and News","summary":"Hey everyone,First off – thank you for your support! Truly, thank you! :) Yes – I know – it's been quiet for a while, but creating a game of this scale turned out to be a lot more work than expected. I simply didn't want to release something unfinished, nor rely on AI. I wanted it to be properly playable.Now for the \"Why\": Why a gas station simulator, anyway? I just think they're awesome and love playing them myself. There's really not much more to it. I think people can easily relate to it, the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-27T20:33:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770243610","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:25:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2876130-1790848102791239","game_id":"steam-2876130","kind":"announcement","title":"Fuel Station Simulator - Copy?","summary":"Unfortunately, we recently discovered that another developer has renamed their game to match ours. Although we have opened a case with Steam, it is likely not something we can take action against – nor do we intend to. Our focus is on creating a new game, not on questionable tactics from competitors. We have no connection whatsoever to the other game with the same name.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-02-11T18:31:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1790848102791239","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:25:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2876130-1786573930983314","game_id":"steam-2876130","kind":"announcement","title":"Happy new year! (and some quick news..) ;-)","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44995273/d2c19c6bc91f796d8df62c647f12b87b95416a6f.jpg At the end of the year, there hasn't been much news about Fuel Station Simulator. We want to thank everyone for the many wishlists and are excited to announce that the release is just around the corner. We hope you’ll have as much fun playing the game as we had creating it. To wrap things up, we wish you a wonderful and healthy 2025 for you and your loved ones. See you soon (at the pump)!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-12-30T21:50:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1786573930983314","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:25:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2876130-5875594803674239225","game_id":"steam-2876130","kind":"announcement","title":"The first step is always the hardest","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44995273/841754e12765a10f72b931cd94ceaf316972e465.png Here’s a little preview of what it might look like when you start your gas station. As mentioned before, every beginning is difficult! It's up to you to expand the gas station and create your own (gas station) empire. Release is getting closer!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-08-14T12:51:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5875594803674239225","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:25:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2876130-5746109972556044554","game_id":"steam-2876130","kind":"announcement","title":"We told you, we'll keep you busy!","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44995273/e55efadac6705f154a2ef4e21a114645bf7e46f9.png Of course, the state visible in the picture is not how you will find it in the game. However, we wanted to give you a little update: We are making great progress and eagerly anticipating our release. Thank you so much for all the wishlists. You are amazing!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-06-08T12:27:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5746109972556044554","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:25:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2876130-5759616966671659791","game_id":"steam-2876130","kind":"announcement","title":"Fuel Station Simulator storepage live!","summary":"Hello everyone! It has already been very exciting for us up to this point. But yesterday it finally happened and our store page went online, which was a very big step for us. Here we want to give you the opportunity to get news about the game already now, as well as to exchange ideas with each other and to get in touch with us. We are very muc